  "not_expressible": {
    "_comment": "Exact types (and exact IAM type + role pairs) that are never in an intent, with the owner of each (plan §2.4). Counted separately from IAC.TYPE_NOT_ALLOWED in the TI-2 expressibility gate. Bindings: the IAP service agent role (policy_tables PLATFORM_OWNED_BINDINGS), GKE Workload Identity bindings with any member (GKE-WI-INTENT: the one expressible form is the typed gke_service_account member on google_service_account_iam_member, a gate rule in shared/iac_intent.py, never this allow-list), project-level invoker / IAP accessor grants (the compute module's per-edge invokers and authorized_invoker_members; the gce-worker launch edge grants instance admin to its launcher). GKE workload objects (kubernetes_deployment / _service / _hpa / _namespace / _service_account) are app manifests (k8s/*.yaml, LLM_AUTHORED, plan §2.1) or the typed kubernetes_manifest, never raw IaC.",
